WEBVTT

01:30.920 --> 01:34.990
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.100 --> 01:37.950
[Episode 11]

01:38.560 --> 01:40.070
In the world of business,

01:40.200 --> 01:41.600
goodwill is everything.

01:42.350 --> 01:43.090
Who would

01:43.120 --> 01:45.039
truly drive someone to ruin? Right?

01:45.039 --> 01:45.840
My apologies.

01:47.070 --> 01:48.400
We'll give you some time

01:48.580 --> 01:49.840
to bow out gracefully.

01:51.070 --> 01:51.680
Alright.

01:51.840 --> 01:52.840
Post the notices.

01:53.430 --> 01:55.400
Let's prepare to return to the capital.

01:55.400 --> 01:58.930
Before we leave, collect
all our outstanding debts in Pingyao.

02:02.200 --> 02:02.840
By the way,

02:03.310 --> 02:05.640
the Eight Families
have asked me to check,

02:05.840 --> 02:07.350
for the 6 million taels of silver,

02:07.350 --> 02:08.240
would you prefer it
to be transported physically by cart,

02:08.240 --> 02:09.560
or provided as banknotes?

02:09.560 --> 02:10.410
My father said

02:11.190 --> 02:12.050
to leave it here

02:12.680 --> 02:14.080
as a gesture of goodwill.

02:15.430 --> 02:16.190
No wonder.

02:17.800 --> 02:18.660
No wonder what?

02:18.930 --> 02:21.190
No wonder your father's business
grew so vast.

02:21.190 --> 02:22.390
That was a remarkably

02:22.800 --> 02:24.060
gracious thing to say.

02:30.310 --> 02:31.150
Are you praising him,

02:31.150 --> 02:32.280
or making a dig at me?

02:33.630 --> 02:34.430
But there's one thing

02:34.430 --> 02:35.960
I genuinely don't understand.

02:35.960 --> 02:37.560
Where exactly did I go wrong?

02:38.120 --> 02:39.240
Enlighten me.

02:39.870 --> 02:41.070
You overestimate me.

02:41.800 --> 02:43.920
I'll need to reflect on this properly.

02:43.920 --> 02:45.650
When you leave for the capital,

02:46.190 --> 02:48.120
I'll give you the answer in person.

03:03.470 --> 03:04.330
Chief Manager.

03:05.750 --> 03:06.880
Greetings, Madam.

03:07.210 --> 03:08.800
Greetings, Mr. Li and Mr. Sun.

03:08.800 --> 03:10.590
-Greetings, Chief Manager.
-Greetings, Chief Manager.

03:10.590 --> 03:11.080
Well,

03:11.470 --> 03:12.630
today I brought just 100 grams

03:12.630 --> 03:14.080
of the finest Da Hong Pao tea

03:14.080 --> 03:15.280
from the mother trees in Fujian.

03:15.280 --> 03:17.079
Let's have it before we start drinking.

03:17.079 --> 03:17.470
Great.

03:17.470 --> 03:18.730
Mr. Gu might be hungry.

03:18.810 --> 03:20.520
Let's have the meal first
and enjoy the tea later.

03:20.520 --> 03:21.050
Alright.

03:21.240 --> 03:22.840
I can't speak for his hunger,

03:23.130 --> 03:24.329
but I've been craving

03:24.360 --> 03:25.560
this tea for ages.

03:26.520 --> 03:28.190
At my age, how could I get so hooked on—

03:28.190 --> 03:28.800
No, no.

03:29.310 --> 03:31.770
I mean, it's all thanks
to the Chief Manager.

03:38.800 --> 03:39.770
The Chief Manager has arrived.

03:39.770 --> 03:40.430
Sir,

03:40.710 --> 03:42.150
I'm like a monkey dressed in royal robes—
utterly unworthy of such honor.

03:42.150 --> 03:43.360
Please, no more jokes at my expense.

03:43.360 --> 03:45.090
You flatter me beyond measure.

03:46.190 --> 03:46.790
After you.

03:59.210 --> 04:01.080
If he can string four words together,

04:01.080 --> 04:02.680
consider it a grand gesture.

04:02.750 --> 04:03.550
My whole life,

04:03.630 --> 04:05.870
I've only heard him speak
in two-word grunts.

04:05.870 --> 04:06.900
Right, Cripple?

04:08.190 --> 04:08.720
Piss off.

04:09.630 --> 04:10.490
See what I mean?

04:18.120 --> 04:18.800
Mr. Gu,

04:21.310 --> 04:23.040
sorry, I mean Chief Manager Gu.

04:23.070 --> 04:24.270
I will ask you a series of questions,

04:24.270 --> 04:25.750
and I expect an answer to each one.

04:25.750 --> 04:27.390
Don't worry about offending us
with your answers—

04:27.390 --> 04:28.390
if you dislike the questions themselves,

04:28.390 --> 04:29.190
just say so.

04:32.550 --> 04:33.190
Very well.

04:34.000 --> 04:36.460
Do you truly wish
to join the Eight Families?

04:43.960 --> 04:44.750
I don't.

04:49.830 --> 04:51.600
To be honest with everyone here,

04:51.600 --> 04:52.820
I'm an exile

04:53.270 --> 04:54.800
who escaped from Ningguta.

04:55.480 --> 04:56.190
The benefactor who saved me

04:56.190 --> 04:57.850
was captured by Wang Tiangui.

04:57.950 --> 04:59.310
He used that to threaten me

04:59.310 --> 05:00.830
and force me into running his business.

05:00.830 --> 05:01.390
His obsession

05:01.390 --> 05:02.460
with joining the Eight Families

05:02.460 --> 05:03.660
stems from his desire

05:03.800 --> 05:05.530
to uncover King Li's Treasure,

05:06.430 --> 05:07.830
which was also the reason

05:07.950 --> 05:10.150
for our previous trip to Jinyang Villa.

05:10.600 --> 05:11.870
This is unexpected.

05:14.640 --> 05:15.810
Now you know

05:16.560 --> 05:17.270
I'm a man without

05:17.270 --> 05:18.530
even a legal identity.

05:18.750 --> 05:20.320
How could I possibly be worthy

05:20.320 --> 05:21.850
of serving as your chief manager?

05:21.850 --> 05:22.850
I've long admired

05:22.950 --> 05:24.430
the Eight Families of Hedong,

05:24.430 --> 05:25.260
and meeting you

05:25.260 --> 05:26.660
only deepens my respect.

05:26.720 --> 05:28.320
The privilege of knowing you

05:28.510 --> 05:29.920
is fortune enough—

05:30.630 --> 05:31.350
I dare not

05:31.720 --> 05:32.870
hope for more.

05:34.790 --> 05:36.750
Please deliberate among yourselves.

05:36.750 --> 05:37.360
I will...

05:38.390 --> 05:39.240
take my leave.

05:40.270 --> 05:41.750
So what if you're an exile?

05:42.040 --> 05:42.870
Even Emperor Taizu of Ming

05:42.870 --> 05:43.870
was once a beggar.

05:44.800 --> 05:47.430
A true hero should be judged
by his deeds, not his origins.

05:47.430 --> 05:47.920
No,

05:47.940 --> 05:48.720
the matters you need to discuss

05:48.720 --> 05:49.780
are confidential.

05:50.130 --> 05:50.950
My staying

05:50.970 --> 05:52.900
would only pose a risk to all of you.

05:53.270 --> 05:54.360
It's better this way.

05:54.360 --> 05:55.040
Mr. Gu.

05:55.680 --> 05:56.390
Mr. Gu.

05:58.159 --> 05:59.620
By entrusting us with your truth,

05:59.620 --> 06:01.350
you've proven your sincerity.

06:01.630 --> 06:02.390
If we still couldn't take you

06:02.390 --> 06:03.480
into our confidence,

06:03.480 --> 06:04.560
then what would that make
the Eight Families of Hedong?

06:04.560 --> 06:05.480
Villains?

06:06.040 --> 06:06.950
Forget

06:06.970 --> 06:08.100
about Wang Tiangui—

06:09.040 --> 06:09.780
I have the deepest respect

06:09.780 --> 06:10.840
for your character

06:11.680 --> 06:12.740
and your judgment.

06:15.510 --> 06:16.240
I accept you.

06:16.800 --> 06:18.800
I am willing to take you
into my confidence.

06:18.800 --> 06:19.510
As am I.

06:20.680 --> 06:21.880
These past months,

06:21.950 --> 06:22.810
our draft banks

06:23.190 --> 06:24.870
have prospered enormously.

06:25.360 --> 06:25.960
Young man—

06:26.070 --> 06:26.510
no,

06:27.920 --> 06:29.120
I mean Chief Manager,

06:30.030 --> 06:31.690
if Wang Tiangui releases you,

06:31.800 --> 06:33.450
I will personally drive you

06:33.470 --> 06:34.600
to my estate.

06:35.270 --> 06:36.870
Must you ramble so?

06:39.720 --> 06:41.510
Wencai, what's your stance?

06:51.240 --> 06:52.100
Chief Manager.

06:53.520 --> 06:54.290
In that case,

06:54.870 --> 06:57.000
Mr. Gu is now one of the Eight Families.

07:01.160 --> 07:02.420
Where are you going?

07:04.680 --> 07:06.310
I purchased this military map

07:06.310 --> 07:08.040
from the Governor of Shandong.

07:17.480 --> 07:19.160
The Prince's troops have

07:20.270 --> 07:21.430
advanced to this location—

07:21.430 --> 07:23.390
the border between Shandong and Henan,

07:23.390 --> 07:24.050
at Caozhou.

07:25.160 --> 07:27.820
You're trying to borrow a knife
to kill someone!

07:27.950 --> 07:28.830
The Prince's cavalry

07:28.830 --> 07:29.800
is invincible,

07:29.870 --> 07:31.480
battle-hardened and triumphant.

07:31.480 --> 07:32.950
How could those unarmed Resistance Army

07:32.950 --> 07:34.210
possibly handle them?

07:36.000 --> 07:37.630
Those poor souls

07:38.100 --> 07:40.159
wouldn't risk their necks rebelling

07:40.270 --> 07:41.330
if they hadn't been

07:41.600 --> 07:43.130
dispossessed of their land

07:43.270 --> 07:44.360
and left homeless.

07:44.950 --> 07:45.680
Throwing them

07:45.680 --> 07:47.140
against seasoned troops—

07:47.190 --> 07:48.720
what if the blade backfires

07:48.870 --> 07:50.400
and gets them slaughtered?

07:51.409 --> 07:53.360
Haven't we funded
the Resistance Army before?

07:53.360 --> 07:54.680
Repeatedly, in fact.

07:55.350 --> 07:57.000
Money is the whetstone—

07:57.920 --> 08:00.320
it determines how sharp the blade becomes.

08:00.390 --> 08:01.720
To clarify for our chief manager:

08:01.720 --> 08:03.050
our trade operations

08:03.430 --> 08:04.800
require dealing

08:04.830 --> 08:06.230
with all local factions.

08:06.300 --> 08:07.510
We maintain relations

08:07.510 --> 08:09.100
with commanders
of the Resistance Army as well.

08:09.100 --> 08:10.480
"Money is the whetstone"—

08:10.480 --> 08:11.310
well said.

08:11.830 --> 08:12.830
What's your plan?

08:15.240 --> 08:17.140
I've had our Hebei branches

08:17.720 --> 08:20.190
acquire 2,000 horses from the grasslands,

08:20.520 --> 08:21.670
shipping them via the Grand Canal

08:21.670 --> 08:22.530
to Shandong.

08:22.800 --> 08:23.620
The plan is to use the horse caravan

08:23.620 --> 08:25.270
to unite all Resistance Army units

08:25.270 --> 08:26.200
across Shandong

08:26.200 --> 08:28.000
and launch a coordinated siege.

08:28.000 --> 08:29.100
I know nothing of military strategy,

08:29.100 --> 08:30.830
but I gave them one clear order:

08:30.920 --> 08:32.850
Don't let that Prince leave alive.

08:35.659 --> 08:36.750
Stop running, you Qing lackeys!

08:36.750 --> 08:38.549
Stop running, you Qing lackeys!

08:39.030 --> 08:39.630
Freeze!

08:40.000 --> 08:40.799
Qing lackeys!

08:41.130 --> 08:41.840
Sir!

08:44.270 --> 08:45.070
Qing lackeys!

08:45.120 --> 08:45.860
Freeze!

08:45.930 --> 08:46.930
Stop right there!

08:47.000 --> 08:48.420
Stop running, you Qing lackeys!

08:48.420 --> 08:49.030
Your Highness!

08:49.030 --> 08:49.840
Your Highness!

08:49.840 --> 08:51.480
Are you alright, Your Highness?

08:51.480 --> 08:52.200
Stop!

08:52.330 --> 08:52.930
Freeze!

09:00.730 --> 09:03.020
[Caozhou, Shandong]

09:30.270 --> 09:32.000
Where are the rear guard units?

09:32.750 --> 09:34.280
Why is there no one in sight?

09:35.000 --> 09:36.240
Have you all gone mute?

09:36.240 --> 09:37.270
Answer me!

09:38.550 --> 09:39.410
Your Highness,

09:39.750 --> 09:41.150
Ling San... that bastard

09:41.470 --> 09:42.600
has turned traitor!

09:46.920 --> 09:48.110
Impossible!

09:48.590 --> 09:50.820
I raised that boy myself.

09:52.660 --> 09:53.720
During the charge,

09:54.120 --> 09:55.710
victory was within our grasp

09:55.710 --> 09:56.630
when Ling San

09:56.650 --> 09:58.280
led his cavalry to strike our flank.

09:58.280 --> 09:59.010
In the chaos,

09:59.320 --> 10:01.140
we couldn't distinguish friend from foe.

10:01.140 --> 10:01.740
That's how

10:02.510 --> 10:04.370
the rebels gained the upper hand.

10:08.380 --> 10:10.000
How could he betray me?

10:16.890 --> 10:17.750
Your Highness,

10:18.220 --> 10:19.650
the rebels outmatch us

10:19.860 --> 10:21.450
in both firearms and cavalry.

10:21.450 --> 10:22.370
Someone must be

10:22.950 --> 10:24.060
backing Ling San.

10:24.720 --> 10:26.450
Let us escort you to safety now.

10:39.410 --> 10:40.550
We've bribed

10:40.840 --> 10:42.390
the Prince's trusted general,

10:42.390 --> 10:43.040
Ling San.

10:43.790 --> 10:46.650
The man was drowning
in 3 million in gambling debts—

10:46.870 --> 10:48.200
we cleared them for him.

10:48.440 --> 10:49.140
He's promised

10:49.140 --> 10:50.910
to turn coat at the critical moment.

10:50.910 --> 10:51.970
When that happens,

10:52.360 --> 10:54.600
the Prince will be trapped between
external threats and internal betrayal.

10:54.600 --> 10:55.850
His defeat is guaranteed

10:55.850 --> 10:57.580
before the battle even begins.

11:05.520 --> 11:06.250
Fall back!

11:07.550 --> 11:08.680
All units fall back!

11:09.700 --> 11:10.900
Fall back! Don't run!

11:11.960 --> 11:13.270
Cowards!

11:46.320 --> 11:48.730
[Taiping Bank]

11:47.930 --> 11:50.390
Make sure everything's
tied down securely!

11:50.640 --> 11:52.370
Tighten those ropes properly!

11:54.720 --> 12:00.430
[Taiping Bank]

11:55.150 --> 11:57.080
Double-check all the fastenings!

11:57.910 --> 11:59.640
Tighten those ropes properly!

12:04.120 --> 12:04.920
Young Master,

12:06.360 --> 12:07.550
the wind is picking up.

12:07.550 --> 12:08.590
You should get in the carriage.

12:08.590 --> 12:10.900
[Taiping Bank]

12:16.630 --> 12:19.100
[Wanyuandang]

12:18.040 --> 12:19.040
What about this?

12:20.200 --> 12:20.840
We'll...

12:21.360 --> 12:22.550
we'll break it into pieces

12:22.550 --> 12:23.610
and take it with us.

12:27.680 --> 12:28.480
When we

12:28.500 --> 12:29.560
erected this here,

12:29.610 --> 12:32.840
[Wanyuandang]

12:29.960 --> 12:31.000
we vowed

12:31.020 --> 12:32.680
it would stand for centuries.

12:35.100 --> 12:36.480
Now barely months later,

12:36.480 --> 12:38.080
we're smashing it to rubble.

12:39.510 --> 12:40.310
Young Master,

12:40.480 --> 12:42.940
victory and defeat
are both part of warfare.

12:44.790 --> 12:45.590
Then break it!

12:46.080 --> 12:47.210
Why the hesitation?

12:48.620 --> 12:50.480
Are you waiting for me to board first?

12:50.480 --> 12:52.330
I thought the sight might distress you.

12:52.330 --> 12:53.620
What is there

12:53.750 --> 12:55.080
to be distressed about?

12:56.030 --> 12:56.870
I'll smash it myself!

12:56.870 --> 13:00.270
Once everything's shattered,
I can leave with peace of mind.

13:08.630 --> 13:10.010
[Taiping Bank]

13:14.030 --> 13:18.920
[Wanyuandang]

13:19.040 --> 13:20.110
[Taiping Bank]

13:20.650 --> 13:21.480
Why are you all standing around?

13:21.480 --> 13:22.030
Smash it now!

13:22.030 --> 13:22.910
Break it apart so we can take it with us.

13:22.910 --> 13:24.640
Hurry up and smash it! Quickly!

13:25.720 --> 13:27.380
Yes, exactly. Catch the rope!

13:28.770 --> 13:29.720
Good, adjust it slightly.

13:29.720 --> 13:30.980
Now get this part down.

13:32.720 --> 13:33.320
Mr. Gu,

13:34.200 --> 13:36.680
now you're Manager Gu—

13:37.130 --> 13:38.920
the rising star of Shanxi's banking world.

13:37.760 --> 13:38.860
[Greeting the Zephyr]

13:39.610 --> 13:40.870
What envy you inspire.

13:42.120 --> 13:43.720
I'm merely playing a role in this opera,

13:43.720 --> 13:44.720
none of it is real.

13:45.680 --> 13:47.210
Beyond these fine clothes,

13:47.630 --> 13:49.560
I don't even have a legal identity.

13:50.270 --> 13:51.730
You lack a legal identity,

13:52.360 --> 13:53.610
while I have nothing

13:54.030 --> 13:54.910
but my status.

13:58.920 --> 14:00.870
This time we served different masters.

14:00.870 --> 14:02.270
Don't hold it against me.

14:02.320 --> 14:03.330
I don't.

14:03.670 --> 14:05.200
If I did, I wouldn't be here.

14:06.080 --> 14:08.540
Truthfully, I hoped you'd
defeat my father.

14:08.870 --> 14:10.870
He clings too closely to officials,

14:11.570 --> 14:13.270
bullying others with borrowed power—

14:13.270 --> 14:14.470
that's no proper way.

14:14.900 --> 14:15.960
You truly think so?

14:17.520 --> 14:18.720
Yet I'm torn.

14:18.760 --> 14:23.020
[Greeting the Zephyr]

14:18.880 --> 14:20.830
I just want to be a proper merchant,

14:21.220 --> 14:22.880
conducting honest business.

14:23.230 --> 14:25.160
But with men like my father around,

14:25.270 --> 14:27.070
I feel I can never truly succeed.

14:28.010 --> 14:28.910
I'm glad to hear

14:29.610 --> 14:30.670
you think that way.

14:33.050 --> 14:33.970
But which path

14:34.630 --> 14:35.840
is the right one?

14:36.960 --> 14:39.290
You're asking the blind
to lead the blind.

14:39.360 --> 14:41.230
How can I call myself a true merchant?

14:41.230 --> 14:43.080
If you're not a merchant,
then what are you?

14:43.080 --> 14:44.800
Those old foxes of the Eight Families

14:44.800 --> 14:46.750
didn't make you chief manager for nothing.

14:46.750 --> 14:47.550
It wouldn't be right

14:47.550 --> 14:49.150
between friends to hold back now.

14:49.150 --> 14:49.840
Very well.

14:50.510 --> 14:51.920
Do you recall our earlier discussion

14:51.920 --> 14:53.520
about the "Dao of the Heart"?

14:54.920 --> 14:56.000
Among all trades—

14:56.030 --> 14:57.470
scholars, farmers, artisans, merchants—

14:57.470 --> 14:59.000
there are exceptional individuals.

14:59.000 --> 15:01.070
Some achieve immortality
through their crafts,

15:01.070 --> 15:02.800
not just through scholarship.

15:02.820 --> 15:09.920
[Greeting the Zephyr]

15:03.160 --> 15:04.860
The recluse Tao Qian,

15:05.010 --> 15:06.120
the artisan Lu Ban,

15:06.640 --> 15:07.670
the merchants

15:07.870 --> 15:08.990
Bai Gui and Fan Li—

15:10.250 --> 15:10.980
their monumental achievements

15:10.980 --> 15:11.790
align with

15:12.120 --> 15:13.580
what Confucius called

15:13.970 --> 15:15.300
"approaching the Dao."

15:16.640 --> 15:17.580
So what exactly

15:17.660 --> 15:18.740
is this Dao?

15:19.900 --> 15:20.910
A principle?

15:21.460 --> 15:22.350
A path?

15:23.090 --> 15:24.120
A treasure

15:24.140 --> 15:25.360
encompassing

15:25.390 --> 15:26.250
all existence?

15:27.390 --> 15:28.510
I often lie awake

15:29.200 --> 15:30.600
pondering this mystery.

15:31.750 --> 15:33.200
I never took Manager Gu

15:33.240 --> 15:34.720
for a truth-seeker.

15:36.350 --> 15:38.150
The exiled convict Gu Pingyuan,

15:38.240 --> 15:39.640
the scholar Gu Pingyuan,

15:39.750 --> 15:41.000
the merchant Mr. Gu—

15:41.300 --> 15:42.960
which is real, which is false?

15:43.440 --> 15:44.510
Are they all true,

15:45.480 --> 15:46.390
all false?

15:47.910 --> 15:49.360
No more riddles.

15:49.780 --> 15:51.240
Since entering commerce,

15:51.630 --> 15:52.920
I've sought the Great Way

15:52.920 --> 15:54.200
in commerce and business.

15:54.200 --> 15:55.870
The ancients said
the Great Way is supremely simple—

15:55.870 --> 15:56.610
so it must be

15:56.640 --> 15:58.030
fundamental principles.

15:58.030 --> 15:59.080
Ultimately,

15:59.720 --> 16:01.670
it boils down to trust and integrity.

16:01.670 --> 16:03.080
Sincerity begets trust,

16:03.500 --> 16:05.440
and benevolence begets righteousness.

16:05.440 --> 16:06.330
Thus merchants

16:06.360 --> 16:08.080
must defend credibility and loyalty

16:08.080 --> 16:09.320
as their very lives.

16:10.630 --> 16:12.080
It sounds pedantic,

16:12.520 --> 16:13.980
but pursued to its zenith—

16:14.040 --> 16:15.140
as demonstrated today—

16:15.140 --> 16:20.780
[Greeting the Zephyr]

16:15.750 --> 16:17.120
the Eight Families

16:17.580 --> 16:18.910
settle accounts with credit notes,

16:18.910 --> 16:21.120
making their capital deployment
ever more agile.

16:21.120 --> 16:22.650
Silver from across the land

16:22.690 --> 16:24.360
floods in because

16:24.670 --> 16:27.130
of their trustworthiness and convenience.

16:27.130 --> 16:28.480
This proves integrity's power

16:28.480 --> 16:30.050
in this world.

16:31.120 --> 16:32.050
Some truths

16:32.080 --> 16:33.030
seem simple,

16:33.430 --> 16:34.690
but without practice,

16:34.840 --> 16:35.840
we never glimpse

16:35.870 --> 16:36.930
their profundity.

16:38.910 --> 16:40.170
After all these years,

16:40.360 --> 16:41.630
you still have that bookish pedantry

16:41.630 --> 16:42.270
about you.

16:42.360 --> 16:43.290
You asked for my thoughts—

16:43.290 --> 16:44.290
don't mock me now.

16:46.140 --> 16:48.120
I'm returning home.

16:48.640 --> 16:50.040
When I next visit Shanxi,

16:50.280 --> 16:51.280
I'll seek you out.

16:52.730 --> 16:53.990
I drift like duckweed—

16:54.030 --> 16:54.750
who knows

16:54.770 --> 16:55.700
where I'll land?

16:56.080 --> 16:56.720
Once

16:57.150 --> 16:58.580
amnesty grants me

16:58.960 --> 16:59.930
freedom,

17:00.270 --> 17:01.330
I'll come find you.

17:02.030 --> 17:03.290
You're leaving again?

17:04.829 --> 17:05.880
Every opera

17:06.480 --> 17:07.760
must end.

17:08.510 --> 17:09.339
I remain here for now—

17:09.339 --> 17:11.400
there are still people I need to save.

17:12.200 --> 17:12.800
Farewell.

17:15.290 --> 17:17.400
[Greeting the Zephyr]

17:17.800 --> 17:18.470
But Mr. Gu,

17:20.349 --> 17:21.859
people will remember

17:22.200 --> 17:23.930
how we shook Pingyao to its core

17:24.030 --> 17:24.849
with gatehouse pawning,

17:24.849 --> 17:25.829
door-to-door pawning,

17:25.829 --> 17:26.920
and temple pawning—

17:26.920 --> 17:28.230
forcing every

17:28.270 --> 17:30.160
draft bank and pawnshop
in Pingyao to kneel!

17:30.160 --> 17:31.200
What glorious madness!

17:31.200 --> 17:32.660
They'll remember indeed.

17:47.390 --> 17:52.870
[Greeting the Zephyr]

17:56.110 --> 17:57.170
Everyone, a toast!

17:57.830 --> 17:59.030
To our chief manager,

17:59.720 --> 18:01.240
Mr. Gu,

18:02.000 --> 18:03.240
and to the Eight Families

18:03.240 --> 18:04.840
for gaining such a talent!

18:05.310 --> 18:05.970
Bottoms up!

18:06.250 --> 18:07.750
Bottoms up! Bottoms up! Bottoms up!

18:07.750 --> 18:08.410
Bottoms up!

18:12.110 --> 18:12.910
Enjoy. Enjoy.

18:12.960 --> 18:13.720
-Enjoy.
-Enjoy.

18:13.720 --> 18:14.720
Help yourselves.

18:17.070 --> 18:17.930
Chief Manager,

18:17.960 --> 18:19.220
you seem preoccupied.

18:20.110 --> 18:21.110
I was thinking...

18:21.590 --> 18:23.880
the Prince had
such a formidable reputation.

18:23.880 --> 18:26.010
Yet he was brought down
just like that?

18:32.030 --> 18:32.990
You

18:33.890 --> 18:35.220
still don't fully grasp

18:36.830 --> 18:39.000
the power of money.

18:45.310 --> 18:46.000
Mr. Gu,

18:47.110 --> 18:48.070
would you like to know

18:48.070 --> 18:49.600
what King Li's Treasure is?

18:51.610 --> 18:54.980
[Pingding Temple]

18:52.270 --> 18:54.130
The so-called King Li's Treasure

18:54.600 --> 18:57.130
is hidden deep
within mountain strongholds,

18:58.530 --> 19:00.590
behind high walls

19:00.700 --> 19:02.230
and intricate mechanisms.

19:02.590 --> 19:03.790
No one but the Eight Families

19:03.270 --> 19:05.940
[Universal Radiance of Buddha]

19:04.550 --> 19:05.750
can access it.

19:21.540 --> 19:22.450
Some claim

19:22.830 --> 19:24.000
the King Li's Treasure

19:24.000 --> 19:26.110
was simply abandoned
by the fleeing King Li

19:26.110 --> 19:27.080
in a valley,

19:27.270 --> 19:28.960
stumbled upon by our ancestors,

19:28.960 --> 19:30.310
and used to build their fortune.

19:30.310 --> 19:31.830
That's pure nonsense.

19:32.920 --> 19:34.680
If fortune were that easy,

19:34.830 --> 19:36.040
the Eight Families
would have torn each other apart

19:36.040 --> 19:37.500
fighting over it long ago.

19:37.770 --> 19:39.100
Don't you agree, Mr. Gu?

19:39.400 --> 19:40.390
Indeed.

19:41.540 --> 19:43.200
A leader like King Li—

19:43.510 --> 19:45.320
seasoned in battle, a visionary—

19:45.320 --> 19:47.250
fought his way out of encirclement

19:47.310 --> 19:48.840
with just eighteen riders.

19:49.070 --> 19:50.200
How could such a hero

19:50.590 --> 19:52.870
fail to protect

19:53.000 --> 19:54.000
his army's funds?

19:54.820 --> 19:56.100
The truth is,

19:56.760 --> 19:57.890
he already knew then

19:58.720 --> 19:59.980
that Heaven's Mandate

20:00.270 --> 20:01.800
had slipped from his grasp.

20:02.070 --> 20:04.160
Unwilling to let his empire
fall entirely into others' hands,

20:04.160 --> 20:04.890
he entrusted

20:05.200 --> 20:06.790
eight of his most loyal commanders

20:06.790 --> 20:07.780
with the wealth

20:07.870 --> 20:09.420
[In Memory of the Valiant General,
Ma Shiyao, Great Shun Dynasty]

20:07.920 --> 20:09.960
accumulated over decades—

20:10.750 --> 20:11.400
including treasures

20:11.000 --> 20:13.870
[In Memory of the Valiant General,
Liu Tichun, Great Shun Dynasty]

20:11.880 --> 20:14.030
taken from Emperor Chongzhen

20:14.350 --> 20:15.550
and confiscated

20:15.680 --> 20:17.000
from corrupt officials.

20:17.000 --> 20:17.730
This fortune

20:17.880 --> 20:20.140
was meant to be the foundation
of the Great Shun Dynasty's restoration—

20:20.140 --> 20:20.890
the means

20:21.070 --> 20:23.130
to reclaim our Han Chinese homeland.

20:25.240 --> 20:27.680
The Eight Families
were ordered to remain here,

20:27.680 --> 20:29.600
using commerce as our cover.

20:30.510 --> 20:31.570
Thus, this fortune

20:33.200 --> 20:35.060
remains with the Eight Families.

20:35.280 --> 20:37.940
And the responsibility rests
on our shoulders.

20:38.070 --> 20:39.050
Our ancestors

20:39.070 --> 20:40.470
have waited generations

20:40.880 --> 20:42.080
for the right moment—

20:42.720 --> 20:44.440
and we may wait generations more,

20:44.440 --> 20:44.960
right?

20:48.180 --> 20:50.380
That is who we, the Eight Families, are.

21:14.570 --> 21:15.310
This hall

21:15.330 --> 21:18.190
is one of the vaults
holding the King Li's Treasure.

21:18.870 --> 21:21.070
These Buddha statues and arhat figures

21:21.440 --> 21:23.240
are all crafted from solid gold.

21:24.470 --> 21:26.350
In all the 200-plus years
of the Qing Empire

21:26.350 --> 21:27.480
besides the leaders

21:27.550 --> 21:29.110
of the Eight Families,

21:29.310 --> 21:31.640
you are the only soul
to learn this secret.

21:33.730 --> 21:35.130
So the King Li's Treasure

21:35.850 --> 21:37.180
was never just a legend.

21:39.720 --> 21:41.320
But these items are so heavy—

21:41.450 --> 21:42.680
how could they have carried them
during military campaigns?

21:42.680 --> 21:43.480
My brother,

21:43.920 --> 21:45.880
no one alive can answer that.

21:48.120 --> 21:49.530
The men around you now

21:49.960 --> 21:52.090
are only in their thirties or forties.

21:52.160 --> 21:53.140
These artifacts

21:53.640 --> 21:56.170
belong to events
from over two centuries ago—

21:56.550 --> 21:57.880
five generations past.

21:59.440 --> 22:01.100
In their time, Mr. Gu Tinglin

22:01.160 --> 22:02.270
and Mr. Fu Qingzhu

22:02.640 --> 22:03.920
established a rule:

22:04.790 --> 22:05.660
each year, the Eight Families

22:05.660 --> 22:07.750
must melt down 10%

22:07.920 --> 22:08.850
of their profits

22:09.200 --> 22:10.790
into gold and silver objects,

22:10.790 --> 22:11.590
stored here.

22:12.750 --> 22:14.320
Grain by grain, the silo fills.

22:14.320 --> 22:15.110
You may call it

22:15.110 --> 22:16.440
the King Li's Treasure,

22:16.720 --> 22:18.110
or you may see it

22:18.160 --> 22:19.240
as the crystallized effort

22:19.240 --> 22:21.200
of every merchant
west of the Yellow River.

22:21.200 --> 22:22.750
Should the nation ever face peril

22:22.750 --> 22:24.280
and need financial rescue,

22:24.700 --> 22:25.900
every last piece here

22:26.180 --> 22:28.180
must be dispersed without reserve.

22:30.410 --> 22:31.400
This was our forefathers' vision—

22:31.400 --> 22:33.530
a heart dedicated to saving the world.

22:33.590 --> 22:35.050
By showing you this today,

22:35.140 --> 22:36.070
we pass on

22:36.630 --> 22:37.860
the Great Way of commerce:

22:37.860 --> 22:39.920
to serve the people and aid the world.

22:40.070 --> 22:42.070
Wealth, in truth, belongs to no one—

22:42.650 --> 22:45.310
it should be held in trust
for all living beings.

22:49.350 --> 22:52.280
I, Gu Pingyuan,
accept this teaching with humility.

23:01.550 --> 23:03.750
I captured Chang Si

23:04.000 --> 23:05.880
and forced you to work for me.

23:06.480 --> 23:07.610
Do you hate me for it?

23:08.110 --> 23:09.440
I wouldn't call it hate.

23:09.880 --> 23:11.210
More like resignation.

23:13.640 --> 23:14.690
Resignation?

23:15.570 --> 23:17.600
No—you had nowhere else to go.

23:18.590 --> 23:19.400
True enough.

23:21.510 --> 23:22.570
Listen, young man.

23:23.370 --> 23:25.230
I'll show you a real path forward.

23:26.790 --> 23:28.270
Look up.

23:29.020 --> 23:31.160
Look at these account books.

23:33.640 --> 23:34.750
You were

23:36.160 --> 23:38.590
never really a scholar—

23:40.000 --> 23:41.310
you are a true merchant,

23:41.310 --> 23:43.920
through and through.

23:45.640 --> 23:48.540
In just a few months,

23:48.590 --> 23:50.320
you've made more for Taiyufeng

23:50.880 --> 23:52.550
than a decade of its usual

23:52.590 --> 23:53.790
banking operations.

23:53.790 --> 23:55.270
You've got talent.

23:58.000 --> 23:59.480
And now you're even

23:59.510 --> 24:01.770
the chief manager of the Eight Families.

24:02.830 --> 24:03.720
So tell me—

24:05.270 --> 24:07.160
how should I reward you?

24:08.310 --> 24:09.570
I own nothing of value.

24:10.060 --> 24:11.660
To me, money is just a burden.

24:14.720 --> 24:16.350
Don't talk like that.

24:17.750 --> 24:19.080
It's always those

24:19.310 --> 24:20.640
without money

24:21.030 --> 24:23.000
who claim money is evil.

24:23.590 --> 24:24.440
Money itself

24:25.000 --> 24:26.960
is neither good nor evil.

24:27.630 --> 24:28.720
With money,

24:29.240 --> 24:31.000
you can accomplish anything.

24:31.790 --> 24:33.200
How could that be bad?

24:34.350 --> 24:35.910
The rich buy carriages

24:36.200 --> 24:37.790
to travel faster.

24:38.960 --> 24:39.920
But as you said—

24:40.920 --> 24:42.110
I have nowhere to go.

24:44.470 --> 24:45.680
What use is speed

24:46.200 --> 24:47.240
to me?

24:55.130 --> 24:55.930
Do you believe

24:55.960 --> 24:57.310
I could send you back

24:57.360 --> 24:58.750
to Ningguta right now?

25:00.070 --> 25:01.000
Do you know

25:01.030 --> 25:02.240
how many people there

25:02.270 --> 25:03.550
want you dead?

25:06.110 --> 25:06.840
I believe it.

25:09.240 --> 25:11.720
But I won't.

25:14.050 --> 25:15.130
If you

25:15.550 --> 25:17.920
could make money for Chang Si,

25:18.640 --> 25:19.880
why not

25:19.900 --> 25:21.720
for me?

25:24.200 --> 25:25.260
Listen, young man,

25:25.720 --> 25:27.910
your showing up here—

25:28.160 --> 25:30.650
that's heaven's will.

25:30.750 --> 25:31.410
It means

25:31.480 --> 25:33.680
you and I are meant to walk the same road.

25:35.880 --> 25:36.880
Look at this room—

25:37.830 --> 25:40.270
all these ledgers,

25:41.350 --> 25:43.550
all this wealth. It's mine.

25:52.310 --> 25:52.960
I…

25:55.800 --> 25:56.860
Do you understand?

25:57.000 --> 25:58.000
Understand what?

25:58.000 --> 25:58.860
Say it plainly.

26:02.030 --> 26:03.020
Become my son

26:03.680 --> 26:05.280
and take the Wang surname...

26:05.720 --> 26:06.560
From that day,

26:06.680 --> 26:08.950
Gu Pingyuan will be dead.

26:09.240 --> 26:11.090
The past will be erased.

26:11.150 --> 26:12.550
Everything starts anew.

26:12.920 --> 26:15.620
You're holding a winning hand.

26:17.010 --> 26:18.470
All the wealth in this room

26:18.720 --> 26:19.930
will be yours.

26:20.000 --> 26:21.340
You'll guard it for me.

26:21.400 --> 26:22.070
When I die,

26:22.110 --> 26:23.270
I'll be buried right here—

26:23.270 --> 26:25.000
watching over it for you.

26:29.790 --> 26:33.840
Chang Si is nothing but a brute—

26:33.920 --> 26:35.650
a mere mortal.

26:36.000 --> 26:38.160
You've already repaid
your debt of conscience.

26:38.160 --> 26:40.290
What more do you need a conscience for?

26:43.430 --> 26:45.200
[Prison]

26:47.160 --> 26:48.960
We have an announcement for you.

26:49.640 --> 26:50.480
Gentlemen.

26:51.070 --> 26:51.930
What is this...

26:52.510 --> 26:54.420
We're here to inform you

26:54.640 --> 26:56.590
that you're going to meet your maker.

26:56.590 --> 26:58.660
It was Mr. Wang Tiangui

26:58.790 --> 27:00.670
who paid for your death.

27:01.110 --> 27:03.270
You're a true hero—

27:03.750 --> 27:05.150
when you reach the underworld,

27:05.150 --> 27:06.440
seek your vengeance on him.

27:06.440 --> 27:07.760
Don't blame the two of us.

27:07.760 --> 27:08.820
I'll confront him!

27:10.650 --> 27:11.850
This is an injustice!

27:12.850 --> 27:13.770
Restrain him!

27:14.400 --> 27:15.180
Hold him down!

27:15.180 --> 27:15.710
Let me go!

27:15.720 --> 27:16.520
Restrain him!

27:16.810 --> 27:17.640
Let me go!

27:35.690 --> 27:36.730
As for Chang Si,

27:36.980 --> 27:38.720
leave it to me.

27:39.240 --> 27:40.550
The lives of that man and his daughter

27:40.550 --> 27:41.590
are in my hands now.

27:41.590 --> 27:43.550
I will see them dead.

27:44.300 --> 27:46.550
I acted alone—

27:47.080 --> 27:49.350
even if I must walk through fire,

27:49.400 --> 27:50.960
it has nothing to do with you.

27:50.960 --> 27:51.590
You just

27:52.720 --> 27:54.350
guard the money for me.

27:55.310 --> 27:56.590
Let me be clear:

27:57.310 --> 27:59.420
I've already taken the girl.

27:59.620 --> 28:01.240
I will claim her life

28:01.270 --> 28:02.590
around this midnight.

28:02.630 --> 28:03.920
I've made sure

28:04.000 --> 28:05.330
they'll say the killer was Wang Tiangui—

28:05.330 --> 28:06.890
not you, Gu Pingyuan.

28:07.720 --> 28:08.570
You just want me

28:08.570 --> 28:09.440
on my knees,

28:10.270 --> 28:11.930
like a dog serving his master.

28:13.090 --> 28:14.090
That, I cannot do.

28:25.390 --> 28:27.260
Fine. Refuse,

28:27.710 --> 28:29.910
and I won't protect your life either.

28:37.830 --> 28:38.550
Father!

28:40.060 --> 28:40.670
Hurry!

28:41.060 --> 28:41.830
You

28:42.210 --> 28:44.360
can reunite with Chang Si and others

28:44.400 --> 28:45.640
in the underworld.

28:46.460 --> 28:47.460
Let's make a deal.

28:52.160 --> 28:54.470
You? What could you possibly offer?

28:54.960 --> 28:57.560
You think you're
in any position to negotiate?

29:02.110 --> 29:03.440
The King Li's Treasure.

29:04.150 --> 29:05.230
Interested?

29:13.210 --> 29:14.010
Stay still!

29:30.750 --> 29:32.590
King Li's Treasure?

29:34.050 --> 29:36.530
That's nothing but a legend.

29:36.720 --> 29:37.830
For centuries,

29:37.860 --> 29:38.930
no one has uncovered

29:38.930 --> 29:40.320
its secret.

29:40.760 --> 29:43.030
Besides, I've looked into it—

29:43.790 --> 29:45.060
the Eight Families

29:45.160 --> 29:46.750
built their fortune year by year,

29:46.750 --> 29:48.570
through dyes and tea.

29:49.030 --> 29:51.970
Do you really think such a prize

29:52.160 --> 29:53.750
would just fall into my lap?

29:55.480 --> 29:56.940
Let me tell you something.

29:57.640 --> 29:58.840
I've just been there.

30:01.510 --> 30:02.240
Where is it?

30:07.960 --> 30:08.790
Hold on.

30:34.550 --> 30:35.500
Mr. Wang says

30:35.530 --> 30:36.640
we can let them go.

30:38.460 --> 30:38.910
[Pingding Temple]

30:39.380 --> 30:40.290
[Pingding Temple]

30:40.990 --> 30:43.330
[Pingding Temple]

31:01.370 --> 31:03.010
They say King Li

31:04.350 --> 31:06.610
eventually became a monk.

31:06.920 --> 31:07.750
I doubt it.

31:08.720 --> 31:10.000
With a temperament like his,

31:10.000 --> 31:11.670
how could he have lived out his days

31:11.670 --> 31:13.070
in quiet contemplation?

31:23.550 --> 31:24.030
Come.

31:24.270 --> 31:25.010
Master,

31:25.230 --> 31:27.080
my family wishes
to commission a Buddhist service.

31:27.080 --> 31:28.210
Would you assist us?

31:28.270 --> 31:28.960
Amitabha.

31:29.050 --> 31:30.050
This way, please.

32:19.350 --> 32:20.150
You, Gu—

32:20.230 --> 32:21.140
walk ahead.

32:32.990 --> 32:34.540
All these dead souls

32:34.830 --> 32:35.880
guarding such

32:35.920 --> 32:37.590
a massive treasure,

32:38.550 --> 32:40.480
yet they can't enjoy a single coin.

32:40.750 --> 32:42.310
What a waste.

32:43.330 --> 32:44.690
If you understand that,

32:45.160 --> 32:45.830
why come here

32:45.830 --> 32:47.420
to guard it alongside them?

32:50.000 --> 32:51.310
I don't like

32:51.330 --> 32:52.550
his way of talking.

32:53.000 --> 32:54.920
Silence him for me later on.

32:55.200 --> 32:55.920
-Yes!
-Yes!

33:18.510 --> 33:19.170
Step aside!

33:19.310 --> 33:20.050
This is mine!

33:25.030 --> 33:25.800
This is mine!

33:29.590 --> 33:30.830
It's all mine!

33:44.800 --> 33:46.730
The treasures here are so immense,

33:47.480 --> 33:48.640
even the Qing Empire's wealth

33:48.640 --> 33:50.150
accumulated over centuries

33:50.150 --> 33:51.510
may not compare!

33:55.720 --> 33:56.310
Master,

34:04.120 --> 34:05.200
are you satisfied?

34:19.960 --> 34:20.469
Master?

34:22.710 --> 34:23.920
It's all mine!

34:25.800 --> 34:26.710
All mine!

34:30.480 --> 34:34.880
All mine!

34:48.210 --> 34:48.889
Let go!

34:49.600 --> 34:50.760
-Let go!
-It's mine.

35:03.000 --> 35:03.920
Stop grabbing!

35:04.480 --> 35:05.630
This is mine!

35:17.840 --> 35:19.970
This is
the "Dragon-breaking Stone"—

35:20.010 --> 35:21.700
built by the craftsmen
who constructed the imperial tombs.

35:21.700 --> 35:22.590
Once it drops,

35:22.910 --> 35:24.140
no one gets out alive.

36:02.070 --> 36:02.870
Open the door!

36:03.000 --> 36:03.960
Get it open!

36:04.310 --> 36:05.110
Open the door!

36:16.990 --> 36:20.660
[Prison]

36:32.630 --> 36:39.390
[Hall of Divine Blessing]

36:42.280 --> 36:43.410
Where is the master?

36:45.140 --> 36:46.740
Gone to guard King Li's gate.

36:52.420 --> 36:53.720
Did you really think
a man like Wang Tiangui

36:53.720 --> 36:55.440
would share his wealth with you?

36:55.440 --> 36:56.230
The moment you learned the truth,

36:56.230 --> 36:57.550
you were marked for death.

36:57.550 --> 36:58.590
His bodyguards

36:59.110 --> 37:00.710
have already dug your grave.

37:01.320 --> 37:02.290
Flee Shanxi now.

37:02.630 --> 37:04.030
The farther, the better.

37:31.280 --> 37:33.030
Heavens!

37:34.360 --> 37:36.370
I, Wang Tiangui,

37:37.230 --> 37:40.450
am richer than you now!

37:41.680 --> 37:51.280
Heaven has made us talents;
we're not made in vain.

38:48.440 --> 38:53.310
[In the 11th year of the Xianfeng era,
the Xianfeng Emperor passed away.]

39:20.010 --> 39:21.610
The Emperor has passed away!

39:21.840 --> 39:23.700
The entire nation is in mourning.

39:24.510 --> 39:25.810
A new reign is upon us.

39:26.180 --> 39:27.880
The new Emperor
will issue a general pardon—

39:27.880 --> 39:28.660
by then,

39:28.840 --> 39:30.420
you'll be a free man.

39:33.670 --> 39:34.690
I'll go buy a horse

39:35.320 --> 39:36.980
and walk through the streets.

39:37.280 --> 39:39.540
The decree should arrive
any moment now.

39:40.280 --> 39:41.280
Don't act rashly.

39:41.590 --> 39:42.550
Wait a little longer.

39:42.550 --> 39:44.080
Let me check outside first.

39:45.340 --> 39:46.000
Father,

39:46.630 --> 39:47.830
let him buy the horse.

39:49.030 --> 39:51.070
The young Emperor's pardon
has been announced—

39:51.070 --> 39:51.960
the magistrate's men

39:51.960 --> 39:54.360
were just shouting
about it in the streets.

39:54.800 --> 39:55.280
Well,

39:56.960 --> 39:57.590
Mr. Gu,

39:58.400 --> 39:58.920
why not

39:59.630 --> 40:00.920
stay a few more days?

40:01.440 --> 40:02.320
We haven't had

40:02.570 --> 40:03.900
enough time together.

40:10.110 --> 40:11.050
Can't you see Gu's heart

40:11.050 --> 40:12.380
is already racing home?

40:13.240 --> 40:14.440
If he had a horse now,

40:15.150 --> 40:15.880
I doubt he'd even

40:15.880 --> 40:17.140
spare us another word.

41:12.070 --> 41:12.670
Mr. Chang.

41:13.000 --> 41:13.800
Once the south

41:13.800 --> 41:14.630
is pacified

41:14.670 --> 41:15.800
and Anhui restored,

41:15.800 --> 41:16.530
you may come—

41:17.250 --> 41:18.000
start a tea trade

41:18.000 --> 41:19.110
with us,

41:19.130 --> 41:20.400
and ship it to the north.

41:20.400 --> 41:20.840
Good.

41:21.230 --> 41:22.430
When that time comes,

41:22.480 --> 41:24.140
I'll seek you out, Mr. Gu.

41:24.360 --> 41:26.110
My family owns half a tea mountain.

41:26.110 --> 41:27.110
We grow Silver Bud

41:27.280 --> 41:27.990
and Hou Kui—

41:28.280 --> 41:29.340
both fine teas.

41:29.710 --> 41:30.630
They should sell well

41:30.630 --> 41:31.840
in the capital.

41:32.430 --> 41:33.280
I've heard

41:33.670 --> 41:35.710
even the Emperor can't get fresh tea—

41:35.710 --> 41:36.440
is that true?

41:36.570 --> 41:37.480
When I was young,

41:37.480 --> 41:38.710
the tea masters said

41:39.000 --> 41:40.200
the reigning Emperor

41:40.670 --> 41:42.600
prefered Golden Thread and Pu'er.

41:43.230 --> 41:45.100
What does he know about fine green tea?

41:45.100 --> 41:46.150
By the time our green tea

41:46.150 --> 41:47.210
reaches the north,

41:47.320 --> 41:48.400
it's almost stale.

41:48.960 --> 41:50.970
Then they scent it with jasmine—

41:51.480 --> 41:52.540
the aroma is there,

41:52.760 --> 41:54.560
but the original flavor is lost.

41:55.180 --> 41:56.440
I've had that jasmine-scented tea

41:56.440 --> 41:57.400
in the capital—

41:57.880 --> 41:59.210
so that's how it's made.

41:59.280 --> 42:01.190
I'll await
your esteemed presence in Anhui.

42:01.190 --> 42:02.670
Once you've recovered your health,

42:02.670 --> 42:03.550
let's try

42:04.110 --> 42:05.240
to reunite in Anhui.

42:05.510 --> 42:06.960
The moment I stepped out of that prison,

42:06.960 --> 42:09.020
my legs started itching for the road.

42:09.190 --> 42:10.280
Over this past year,

42:10.280 --> 42:11.480
I've come to realize—

42:11.840 --> 42:14.100
I'm only truly alive
when I'm traveling.

42:15.670 --> 42:16.280
Mr. Gu,

42:19.800 --> 42:20.400
take care

42:21.710 --> 42:22.640
on your journey.

42:48.920 --> 42:50.550
-Your Highness.
-Your Highness.

42:50.550 --> 42:52.880
This southern expedition
must be executed flawlessly.

42:52.880 --> 42:53.540
-Yes!
-Yes!

42:55.690 --> 42:56.790
Wait for us at the foot of the mountain.

42:56.790 --> 42:57.710
-Let's go.
-Let's go!
